From 535f13247f83485eb0de4b97e324808f60030d82 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 00:18:10 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Contact page item 3: the owner sets warmth, keeps their own
 labels and excludes a contact from one goal

The frontend's 21:10Z item 3 (Misho's yes). PUT /contacts/:id/warmth writes the owner's hand-set tier (human_relationship_tiers), keeping the tier it replaced so null restores it (migration 241). POST/DELETE /contacts/:id/labels keep the owner's own labels as UserTags source USER_CREATED, removing only those; the page carries own_labels. POST /contacts/:id/exclusions {goal_id} excludes from one of the owner's goals by its title, stored by digits as the page reads it, with goal_id on each exclusion. All behind withOwnContact. FOR_FRONTEND carries the contract.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01HwFREQwL5g9E6qRrUf9bau
